   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The model never decides what's true. stage2-matching.ts exact-matches every model-generated citation against the rows\nDynamoDB actually returns; nothing absent from the table can reach Stage 3, so a hallucinated statute cannot appear in the final letter.",
   "originalText": "The model never decides what's true. stage2-matching.ts exact-matches every model-generated citation against the rows\nDynamoDB actually returns; nothing absent from the table can reach Stage 3, so a hallucinated statute cannot appear in the final letter.",
